      "id": "13546",
      "body": "User:5a0a358ff23676559cf1b2ba  to confirm when will the start date of the new designer that Angelo will be working with",
      "author": {
        "display_name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "name": "Hazel Marie Cacalda",
        "email": "hazel.marie.i.banaz@accenture.com",
        "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/883ff1fae0c6179bdff495757469823d?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FHC-4.png"
      },
      "created": "2026-07-28T13:08:45.639+1000",
      "updated": "2026-07-28T13:08:45.639+1000"
