      "key": "SFCC-526",
      "summary": "Store Detail – Nearby Boutiques Section",
      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see boutiques near the one I'm viewing, so that I can find an alternative location if this store is not convenient.\nSection at the bottom of the store detail page displaying up to 2 nearby boutique cards. Each card shows: boutique image, boutique name, full address, live open/closed status badge, and an \"Explore Boutique\" CTA link navigating to that boutique's store detail page. Proximity is determined by comparing store coordinates in the SFCC Store Inventory module — closest stores within the same storefront region are surfaced. Section is hidden if fewer than 1 nearby boutique exists in the region.\nSurface: PWA Kit / SFCC store detail page.\nOwner: SFCC/PWA Kit.\nDependency: SFCC-519 (store detail page template); SFCC-50 (store data model with coordinates); SFCC-518 (boutique data API); SFCC-515 (open/closed status badge); SFCC-455 (opening hours feed).",
