      "description": "As a Shopper, I want to see the boutique's location on a small inline map and get directions, so that I can easily navigate to the store.\nSmall inline Google Maps embed on the store detail page with a pin at the boutique's coordinates. Below or alongside the map a \"Directions\" link opens Google Maps in a new tab pre-populated with the boutique address as the destination. The boutique's coordinates are sourced from the SFCC Store Inventory module. Map must render correctly across all breakpoints.\nSurface: PWA Kit / SFCC store detail page.\nOwner: SFCC/PWA Kit.\nCross-epic dependency: SFCC-64 (Google Maps API); SFCC-519 (store detail page template); SFCC-50 (store data model for coordinates).",
