      "summary": "Homepage & Navigation",
      "description": "Epic Summary\nBuild the Zimmermann homepage layout and all global navigation components, including header, footer, and megamenu. Integrate with Contentful for hero banners, editorial content, and product carousels, with support for regional content variations per storefront.\nBusiness Value / Objective\nThe homepage and navigation are the first touchpoints for every customer visit. A well-built, content-managed homepage and intuitive navigation directly supports conversion and brand experience, while the Contentful integration gives Zimmermann's team the ability to update content without developer involvement post-launch.\nScope\nIn Scope:\nHomepage layout and content components (hero banners, editorial content, product carousels)\nHeader and footer components across all storefronts\nMegamenu / global navigation\nContentful integration for homepage content blocks\nRegional content variations per storefront\nOut of Scope:\nCountry selector and storefront switcher — covered in Regional Storefronts (SFCC-19)\nSearch bar functionality — covered in Search & Recommendations (SFCC-7)\nMotion/animation behaviour — covered in Motion Design (SFCC-86)\nDependencies\nSFCC-2 (PWA Kit Components) — shared UI components must be available\nSFCC-19 (Regional Storefronts) — storefront locale config must be in place\nOmneo integration — required for customer sign-up/account entry points surfaced in the header\nContentful integration and content authoring by Zimmermann team\nZimmermann to provide Figma designs for homepage and navigation\nAssumptions & Constraints\nContent authoring in Contentful is Zimmermann's responsibility; Accenture scope is limited to the SFCC-side Contentful cartridge integration\nRegional content variations are managed via Contentful's locale model, not custom SFCC logic",
