      "id": "17845",
      "key": "SFCC-19",
      "summary": "Regional Storefronts",
      "description": "Epic Name:\n Regional Storefronts\nEpic Summary\nThis epic covers the configuration of all 8 regional storefronts in SFCC, including IP geolocation routing, country/language selector, EU language modal, localisation for EU multi-language support, marketing opt-in, and data privacy compliance (GDPR, DSAR, right-to-erasure).\nBusiness Value / Objective\nZimmermann operates across 8 storefronts serving distinct markets with different currencies, tax models, languages, and legal requirements. Getting storefront configuration, geolocation routing, and consent management right at go-live is critical for both customer experience and regulatory compliance.\nScope\nIn Scope:\n8 storefront site configuration in BM (AU, US domestic, US international, UK, EU domestic, EU international, HK, ME)\nIP geolocation routing and country slide-out (excl. AU which is gated)\nCountry and language selector across all storefronts\nEU language mismatch modal (EN/FR/IT/ES)\nEU multi-language support (11 locales across 8 storefronts)\nMarketing opt-in capture at checkout and registration, synced to Omneo\nData privacy — right-to-erasure, DSAR, data retention, consent audit log, breach reporting via SFCC GDPR cartridge\nOut of Scope:\nCookie consent — covered in Analytics epic\nTranslation execution — Contentful/Transperfect, Zimmermann scope\nCheckout configuration per storefront — covered in SFCC-12 (Checkout Flow & Delivery)\nPricing and currency per storefront — covered in SFCC-18 (Pricing)\nDependencies\nContentful — localised content per storefront and locale\nOmneo/Emarsys — marketing opt-in preference sync\nAssumptions & Constraints\nAU storefront is gated to AU and NZ/Pacific Island IP addresses; no inbound cross-navigation from other storefronts\nEU domestic supports 4 languages (EN/FR/IT/ES); all other storefronts are English only\nTranslation pipeline is Zimmermann/Transperfect scope; SFCC serves translated content once delivered to Contentful",
